[ti:The Clean Knife of Truth]
[ar:EdgarAllanMusic]
[al:EcceH.text (Revalued)]
[00:32.54]I watched the ideals freeze like statues old
[00:36.70]Compassion turned to chains, forgiveness cold
[00:40.78]I cut the cord that tied me to their lies
[00:44.98]A cleanliness of soul, my law, my prize
[00:49.08]Resentment found no room in me to stay
[00:53.10]Revenge got bored and quietly walked away
[00:57.23]Round the corner a saint froze in his prayer
[01:01.47]I didn't push him, I just let in the air
[01:07.36]No more halos on the wall
[01:11.06]Just a torch that doesn't flicker
[01:15.41]I carry the clean knife of truth
[01:19.04]And every lie gets thinner
[01:23.26]
[01:31.92]The weak called it cruel, the strong called it free
[01:36.17]I called it truth, and it called back to me
[01:39.71]I don't refute an idol I just pull my gloves on
[01:43.85]And lay another error gently on the frost
[01:47.98]The genius freezes first, the hero in his ice
[01:52.13]It's a war that leaves no smoke and asks no sacrifice
[01:56.29]I owe the past no guilt, I leave its debt unpaid
[01:59.95]I keep a steady light, and truth's cold blade
[02:05.26]No more idols made of clay
[02:08.91]Let them learn what legs are for
[02:13.38]I carry the clean knife of truth
[02:17.07]I don't swing it anymore
[02:21.13]
[02:28.79]...it freezes
[02:31.67]
[02:38.61]Even the faith turned into frost
[02:42.70]And nobody raised a hand
[02:46.92]The cold did all the work for me
[02:51.09]And I could finally stand
[02:57.26]Yes to the cold and to the light
[03:00.32]To everything the blade has shown
[03:05.03]I carry the clean knife of truth
[03:08.65]It cut me first, down to the bone
[03:10.80]
